# Evolve (CR 702.100a): "Whenever a creature you control enters, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this
# creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Cloudfin Raptor is 0/1. Fugitive Wizard (1/1) has greater power only
# (1 > 0, 1 = 1): the Raptor is 1/2. Aegis Turtle (0/5) has greater toughness only (0 < 1, 5 > 2): the Raptor is 2/3.
# Merfolk of the Pearl Trident (1/1) has neither (1 < 2, 1 < 3), so evolve does not trigger: the stack is empty once it has entered. Black Lotus (three blue)
# and Mox Sapphire (one) pay for the four one-mana creatures.

